{"route":{"id":"17137","name":"Passejada fins al Castrum Visigòtic","intro":"Aquest breu itinerari d'anada i tornada ens permet, a través d'una breu passejada apta per a tots els públics, arribar i conèixer una mica millor el <strong>Castrum Visigòtic o el poblat del Puig Rom</strong>, segurament unes de les restes <strong>visigòtiques més significatives de la península Ibèrica</strong>. Pujarem observant aquesta rodals caracteritzats per les <strong>brolles esquitxades d'alzines i pins</strong> així com algun conreu d'<strong>olivera i vinya</strong> que encara sobreviuen a les parts més planes.","tipus":"Circular horari","dificultat":"Familiar","durada":"50 minuts","desnivell":"120.00 meters","distancia":"2.70 km","tema":"Medi, Medi i arquitectura","imgs":["n17137_1.jpg","n17137_2.jpg","n17137_3.jpg","n17137_4.jpg"],"url":"https://naturalocal.net/ca/rutes-senderisme-catalunya/rutes-senderisme-girona/rutes-senderisme-roses/passejada-fins-al-castrum-visigotic","track":[[42.2554,3.19808],[42.25531,3.19815],[42.25526,3.19821],[42.25521,3.19829],[42.25509,3.19833],[42.25494,3.19827],[42.25487,3.19821],[42.25477,3.19815],[42.25475,3.198],[42.25475,3.19786],[42.25475,3.19773],[42.25474,3.19757],[42.25473,3.19745],[42.25473,3.19733],[42.25471,3.1972],[42.25471,3.19707],[42.25471,3.19693],[42.2547,3.19684],[42.25469,3.19672],[42.25467,3.19659],[42.25465,3.19646],[42.25465,3.19634],[42.25466,3.19622],[42.25468,3.19607],[42.2547,3.19594],[42.25474,3.1958],[42.25476,3.19565],[42.25472,3.19555],[42.25466,3.19548],[42.25457,3.19544],[42.25449,3.19543],[42.2544,3.19541],[42.25428,3.19537],[42.25418,3.19535],[42.2541,3.1953],[42.25399,3.19525],[42.25391,3.1952],[42.25383,3.19515],[42.25373,3.19505],[42.25365,3.19498],[42.25357,3.19489],[42.25348,3.19478],[42.2534,3.19468],[42.25331,3.19459],[42.25324,3.1945],[42.25319,3.19438],[42.25318,3.19425],[42.25322,3.19419],[42.25332,3.19406],[42.25338,3.19394],[42.25345,3.19382],[42.2535,3.19371],[42.25355,3.1936],[42.25361,3.19351],[42.2